------- OpenFAST-compatible rigid NREL 5 MW smoke input ------------------------
False Echo               - Echo input data
1     NRotors            - Number of rotors
1     CompElast          - ElastoDyn supplies initial rigid geometry
2     CompAero           - AeroDyn input format
F     MirrorRotor        - Use the normal rotor direction
"NREL5MW_ElastoDyn.dat" EDFile
"NREL5MW_AeroDyn.dat"  AeroFile
